  m_text: '<i>Weapon Notes : </i>


    - Press A / X to Release Slide. Press B /
    Y to eject clips.


    - Ammo Capacity is 1:1 with magazine size : bullets are
    removed from the clip for each shot.


    - You can grab ammo from your waist
    holster when you have a weapon equipped


    - Check out the Weapons scene for
    more

'
